@lib_timeline
is-special: true
go-to: menu

= Timeline of the Republic to 33 BBY

**c. 25,000 BBY**: The Galactic Republic is founded.

**c. 1,000 BBY**: The New Sith Wars end at the Battle of Ruusan. The **Ruusan Reformation** disbands the Republic's armies, reorganises the Senate and places the Jedi Order under the Republic's laws. The Sith are believed destroyed.

**The following centuries**: The Senate grows vast and slow. The great trade guilds gain Senate representation, and the free-trade zones of the Outer Rim make them rich.

**c. 40 BBY**: Finis Valorum, scion of an old Core family, is elected Supreme Chancellor on a promise to clean up the Senate.

**33 BBY**: The game begins. The Yinchorri are restless. The Trade Federation is arming. A senator from Naboo is very patient.

